Description: find Qt6 GuiPrivate package explicitly for Qt >= 6.10
 KF6GlobalAccel links Qt6::GuiPrivate in the WITH_X11 branch. Since
 Qt 6.10 the private module targets (such as Qt6::GuiPrivate) are
 split into standalone CMake packages and are no longer created by
 the main module's find_package call. Without an explicit lookup the
 CMake generation of kf6-kglobalaccel fails against Qt 6.12 with:
 .
   Target "KF6GlobalAccel" links to:
   Qt6::GuiPrivate
   but the target was not found.
 .
 Add a version-gated find_package(Qt6 REQUIRED COMPONENTS GuiPrivate)
 right before the target_link_libraries call. Builds against
 Qt <= 6.9 are unchanged.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-16

--- a/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -48,6 +48,12 @@
 )
 
 if(WITH_X11)
+    # Qt 6.10 起，私有模块目标(如 Qt6::GuiPrivate)拆分为独立的 CMake 包，
+    # 不再随主模块的 find_package 自动创建，需要显式查找，否则 CMake 配置阶段报
+    # "Target ... links to: Qt6::GuiPrivate but the target was not found"。
+    if(Qt6_VERSION VERSION_GREATER_EQUAL 6.10)
+        find_package(Qt6 REQUIRED COMPONENTS GuiPrivate)
+    endif()
     target_link_libraries(KF6GlobalAccel PRIVATE Qt6::GuiPrivate) # qtx11extras_p.h
 endif()
 
